<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merck downgraded on price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merck downgraded on price.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Madison Research analyst William Plovanic said he downgraded Merck &amp; Co Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>--He said he made the move based on price.</p>
<p>--Shares in the drugs giant were off 1/8 to 93-3/8.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
